{"title":"Dune Captain","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 45 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (1.2% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>35</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>27</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>21</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>5</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>35</td><td>in the wilds around 1805, 1050</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>27</td><td>in the wilds around 1814, 1055</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>21</td><td>in the wilds around 1801, 1046</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>25</td><td>in the wilds around 1803, 1050</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>5</td><td>in the wilds around 1802, 1064</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-captain?lv=51\" title=\"Pick level 51\"><td><b>51</b></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-captain\" data-map-level=\"49\">Show level 49 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/b9a61e60c6aa717553b1.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/81048038864ef94443bc.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragon